From a87be2d877c21e67d09cc9e17d3dde4777e5150b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:08:47 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: Replace Event::KINDS with EventKind enum

Add the string-backed EventKind enum with label() and options(),
validate kind with EventKind::tryFrom, add Event::kindLabel() and use
the enum in views, populate and acceptance tests.
